export const getSupplierPerformance = (params: Record<string, string | number | undefined> = {}) => { const q = queryString(params); return api<{ data: { data: SupplierEvaluation[]; current_page: number; last_page: number; total: number }; methodology: string }>('/purchasing/suppliers/performance' + (q ? '?' + q : '')); };
export const createSupplierPerformanceEvaluation = (data: Record<string, unknown>) => api<{ data: SupplierEvaluation }>('/purchasing/supplier-evaluations', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(data) });
export type SupplierPortalMe = { membership: { id: string; role: string; status: string; supplier: Supplier; company: { id: string; name: string } }; user: { id: string; name: string; email: string } };
export type SupplierPortalOrder = { id: string; number: string; order_date: string; expected_at?: string | null; currency?: { code: string }; items?: Array<{ id: string; product?: string; sku?: string; quantity: string; uom?: string; unit_price: string; line_total: string }> };
export const getSupplierPortalMe = () => api<{ data: SupplierPortalMe }>('/supplier-portal/me');
export const getSupplierPortalDashboard = () => api<{ data: { open_purchase_orders: number; awaiting_acknowledgement: number; upcoming_deliveries: number; submitted_shipments: number; open_corrective_actions: number; conversations: number; supplier: Supplier; company: { id: string; name: string } } }>('/supplier-portal/dashboard');
export const getSupplierPortalPurchaseOrders = (params: Record<string, string | number | undefined> = {}) => { const q = queryString(params); return api<{ data: { data: SupplierPortalOrder[]; current_page: number; last_page: number; total: number } }>('/supplier-portal/purchase-orders' + (q ? '?' + q : '')); };
export const acknowledgeSupplierPortalOrder = (id: string, data: { type: string; notes?: string; idempotency_key: string }) => api<{ data: unknown }>('/supplier-portal/purchase-orders/' + id + '/acknowledge', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(data) });
export const acceptSupplierPortalInvitation = (token: string) => api<{ data: unknown }>('/supplier-portal/invitations/accept', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify({ token }) });
